+bharhut | 125 BCE..100 BCE | Bharhut | religion, arts, language | central | Bharhut | The Bharhut stupa | Bharhut, in the Satna district of Madhya Pradesh, is known for a Buddhist stupa whose carved panels are each labelled in Brahmi characters. Recent authors date the reliefs of its railings to about 125–100 BCE. | At Bharhut the carvings on a Buddhist stupa have labels in writing that tell you what each picture shows. They are about 2,100 years old.
